  "origin": {
    "kind": "new",
    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit after the parametric spring model of Valimaki, Parker and Abel (JAES 2010): each spring is a feedback delay loop dispersed by a cascade of 100 first-order allpasses stretched to a transition frequency, here run at a reduced sample rate as in their efficient form. The low-frequency chirp structure only; not a model of any particular tank."
